  "description": "The ALL NEW BIRIA Electric Folding GLIDE\nBiria introduces the all new Glide. This new bike is equipped with all BAFANG components, delivering exceptional performance and reliability. It features a powerful BAFANG 750W motor with up to 80 Nm of torque for strong acceleration and hill-climbing capability. The BAFANG 48V 15Ah battery (UL-certified) provides ample range (up to 75 miles) and efficient power delivery for extended rides. Paired with a BAFANG controller, torque sensor and throttle, the system ensures smooth, responsive pedal assist and throttle operation. The large 3.5 inch color display provides ample vision and readability. The Glide is also equipped with a high quality suspension fork, front and rear integrated lights, brake light and signal lights, horn, heavy duty rear rack, front rack, full fenders, and a heavy-duty kickstand. The Glide offers a premium, dependable ride ready for daily commutes or adventures. This is the most powerful and complete electric folding bike we have ever made.",
